    "final_answer": "I now have enough information to identify the 5 burger places. Let me record my findings:\n\n**Hamburger restaurants (汉堡店) found near 44012:**\n\n1. **Swensons Drive-In** - 4.5 stars (2,295 reviews) - 36041 Main St\n2. **Culver's** - 4.4 stars (2,912 reviews) - 1439 Center Rd\n3. **Red Robin Gourmet Burgers and Brews** - 4.3 stars (2,066 reviews) - 35858 Detroit Rd\n4. **Five Guys** - 4.3 stars (786 reviews) - 36050-A Detroit Rd\n5. **Johnny's Diner** - 4.1 stars (14 reviews) - 32822 Walker Rd\n\n## Final Answer: 5 Places That Serve Burgers Near ZIP Code 44012 (Sorted by Highest Rating)\n\n| Rank | Place | Rating | Reviews | Address |\n|------|-------|--------|---------|---------|\n| 1 | **Swensons Drive-In** | ⭐ 4.5 | 2,295 | 36041 Main St |\n| 2 | **Culver's** | ⭐ 4.4 | 2,912 | 1439 Center Rd |\n| 3 | **Red Robin Gourmet Burgers and Brews** | ⭐ 4.3 | 2,066 | 35858 Detroit Rd |\n| 4 | **Five Guys** | ⭐ 4.3 | 786 | 36050-A Detroit Rd |\n| 5 | **Johnny's Diner** | ⭐ 4.1 | 14 | 32822 Walker Rd |\n\nThese 5 places were identified as official \"Hamburger restaurants\" (汉堡店) in the Google Maps category for the Avon Lake, OH 44012 area. They are sorted from highest to lowest rating as requested. Note that Swensons Drive-In has the highest rating (4.5), while Culver's has the most reviews (2,912) with a 4.4 rating.",
